    description: "Slices from a Go program's main stop at cobra command dispatch.\n\nREPRO: hypergumbo slice --entry auto on caddy (PR 6 branch, picks cmd/caddy/main.go) reaches 3 nodes; podman's main reaches 58. The call graph does not follow cobra's Command{RunE: ...} / AddCommand registration, so subcommand handlers are not reached from main. Found by PR 6 agent 2 (2026-11-20) while building WI-dufuz: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr6/dufuz/RESULTS.md."  # e682
